{"v":2,"catch":"大正帝都的怪奇偵探傳，正式復活","desc":"那個《惡魔召喚師 葛葉雷道 對 超力兵團》經過大幅升級各項元素後，終於推出Remaster版了！\n\n大正二十年，帝都。\n「請你殺了我。」\n一名女學生留下這句話後，便被惡魔帶走而下落不明。整個事態最後將會發展成震撼帝都全境的大災難。\n葛葉雷道表面上是實習偵探，但實際上是守護帝都的惡魔召喚師。在追查女學生下落的時候，卻找到了隱藏在事件背後的意外真相。\n\n化身為守護帝都的英雄葛葉雷道，運用惡魔之力解開謎題、遊玩爽快的戰鬥祓除邪惡吧！","publisher":"SEGA","release":"2025-06-19","genres":["角色扮演","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"size":"Switch 2 13.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81924dc608689810ef09c5408648f619039debca3feb835e374860a437ff54bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b39f7fffcc9f09dbfca9220282e09032438f426b0d3f0bc15fd8f71bb24cac8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/221bc9cae59091a7a57a30d2d3fc883e7519c07a48f57d6d775f1e036a296729.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f999f043fdd2d3353cd1d02b91b256fb57753cdcb78e85afebebf8277297475.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/09fa270f75b1e984669c38ef439c1e1c5604210f6e94699e20a0d5d041b52188.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7721c253d68903a98a5855124c2cac069b6331dd3a2366d9d1fe938edbf7efd0.jpg"],"dlc":[{"id":"70070000027711","name":"RAIDOU Remastered: 超力兵團奇譚 超DLC同捆包","img":"7c8d18048acd4214863bf76c09e942f8d73eaa3f66be86c394a69e7564b1b2df","date":"2025-06-19","mem":false},{"id":"70050000056635","name":"和惡魔返鄉的男人全集","img":"4d5ad385bc8c190e37061e81f7470fcabf818fcba19a982022b730007609d24f","date":"2025-06-19","mem":false},{"id":"70050000056636","name":"石榴之鬼","img":"5d6e713261b0e29257df706064eb6f92c320907863f0ee130d238df34848981e","date":"2025-06-19","mem":false}],"dlcTotal":9,"titleId":"0400f4e022f4c000"}